Train Clerk, Commercial Cum Ticket Clerk (CCTC), Accounts Clerk Cum Typist, and Junior Clerk Cum Typist. Candidates should download the notification PDFs given below and go through them thoroughly to get complete information about the recruitment.   Download RRB NTPC Graduate Notification 2026 PDF   Download RRB NTPC UG Notification 2026 PDF   What’s New in RRB NTPC Notification in 2026?   RRB has removed the CBAT/CBTST stage from RRB NTPC 2026-27 recruitment, which means that there will not be any Typing Test or Aptitude Test for Graduate-level posts. The new selection process includes CBT 1, CBT 2, DV, and Medical Examination.   Total vacancies for graduate-level posts has been increased to 3548 from 3477 previously.   RRB NTPC Graduate CBT-I 2026 is tentatively scheduled for the fourth week of December 2026.   Recruitment for RRB Station Master post will be conducted separately from this year onwards for 1250 vacancies.   Preparing for RRB NTPC 2026 Exam? Share Details With Us   RRB NTPC Notification – Highlights   Important Highlights of RRB NTPC 2026-27 Recruitment   Conducting Body : Railway Recruitment Board   Exam Name: RRB NTPC 2026   Post Name: Goods Train Manager, CCTS, JAA, and Senior Clerk cum Typist, Trains Clerk, CCTC, Accounts Clerk cum Typist, and Junior Clerk cum Typist   Pay Level: Level 2, 3, 5 and 6   CEN No.: CEN 06/2026 and CEN 07/2026   Vacancy: 5,236   Age Limit: 18 to 33 years (as on 1/1/2027) for Graduate and 18 to 30 years for UG   Qualification: Bachelor’s degree/12th pass   Application Mode: Online   Selection process : CBT 1, CBT 2, Document Verification (DV), and Medical Examination.   Official website: www.rrbapply.gov.in     Preparing for RRB NTPC 2026? Share your Details With Us   RRB NTPC Recruitment 2026 – Important Dates   Events Graduate Level Dates UG Level Dates   Indicative Notice Release Date 21st September 2026 21st September 2026   Detailed PDF 7th October 2026 14th October 2026   Opening Date of Online Application 8th Oc